    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 13 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Renown 25+ with House Lyrandar<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Cramped<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Empower</p><p>This helm lets a mobile Bastion built in an elemental airship or elemental galleon travel. Its hireling is a dragonmarked heir of House Lyrandar; on an elemental airship, the Helm crew station is part of this facility.</p><p><strong>Empower: Travel.</strong> The hireling pilots the Bastion to a destination you name, at the vehicle's speed, 8 hours a day, for the Bastion turn. It stops early when it arrives or if something stops it. When you issue this order, the DM also rolls on the Bastion Events table as if you had issued the Maintain order.</p><p><em>Source: Eberron: Forge of the Artificer.</em></p>",
